{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Apple 發佈支援文件，說明 Apple Watch 在夏令時間調整後仍顯示相差一小時的時間時應如何處理。Apple 表示，當手腕放下時，這個錯誤時間只會出現在 Always On 螢幕上；點按螢幕或抬起手腕啟動螢幕後，時間便會回復正確。</p>\n<h2>切換錶面或重新啟動</h2>\n<p>Apple 指出，遇到此問題可先切換至另一個錶面，然後切回原本錶面；或直接重新啟動 Apple Watch。MacRumors 此前報道，歐洲時鐘早前回撥時，當地也有 Apple Watch 用戶遇到類似情況；美國大部分地區則於 11 月 1 日（星期日）回撥時鐘。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 Apple Watch 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"551\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/applewatchs10.webp\" width=\"980\"/></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/149603\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">消息來源</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:47.566006+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":269,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T11:49:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T14:18:32.582881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:04.798337+00:00","content_hash":"ac159aa6ce4adc3dda47344c3350d197cd7cde52711b682573abf882a6584e40","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:47.566006+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}